WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.572 --> 00:00:11.392
Welcome to Sitetru. When you sign in, you see every project your company is running, with how far along each one is.

2
00:00:11.393 --> 00:00:17.715
To start a new job, press Add Project, give it a name and a few details, and it appears here.

3
00:00:17.715 --> 00:00:23.375
Open a project to work on it. Everything for that job now lives in one place.

4
00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:33.630
The menu on the left is the whole app: plan the work, record the day, buy material, track labour and cost, bill the client, and keep documents.

5
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:42.851
Running more than one site? Press Switch at the top to jump to another project. The other guides take each part of the menu in turn.
